{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01PBBbjTPuxwogxLiJtTtt3A","type":"tool_result","content":"1\tnarrative_guidance: 'Claim 1 调整为 \"principled detection framework with characterized\n2\t  operating conditions\"： 检测在 3/4 家族有效（|d|>2.0 @ 15%），1 家族信号较弱（|d| 1.0-2.0）。 HellaSwag/GSM8K\n3\t  效果显著但 d 值受 n_items 制约。θ-fixed 在多数家族恢复单调性但非全部。 Baseline 对比诚实报告 information-access\n4\t  vs detection-power tradeoff，强调 minimal-information operating point 价值。 Post-RL 若不完整降为\n5\t  Discussion 中 structural argument + preliminary evidence。 标题可调整为 \"Detection and Characterization\n6\t  of Benchmark Contamination via IRT Person-Fit\"。\n7\t\n8\t  '\n9\timagined_experiments:\n10\t- name: Controlled Contamination Pilot\n11\t  plan_id: exp-ctrl-contam-pilot\n12\t  description: 'Qwen3.5-9B × MMLU, 4 conditions (0%-s1/0%-s2/15%/50%)。 Go/no-go 信号：Δlz*\n13\t    是否显著，clean-vs-clean noise floor，memorization fraction。\n14\t\n15\t    '\n16\t  expected_results:\n17\t    clean_s1_lz_star: 8.2\n18\t    clean_s2_lz_star: 7.5\n19\t    clean_mean_lz_star: 7.85\n20\t    clean_std_lz_star: 0.49\n21\t    contam_15_lz_star: 5.1\n22\t    contam_50_lz_star: 6.8\n23\t    contam_15_delta_lz_star: -2.75\n24\t    contam_50_delta_lz_star: -1.05\n25\t    cohens_d_contam_15: -2.5\n26\t    cohens_d_contam_50: -0.95\n27\t    clean_vs_clean_delta: 0.7\n28\t    memorization_fraction_15pct: 0.35\n29\t    memorization_fraction_50pct: 0.28\n30\t    contam_15_acc: 0.72\n31\t    contam_50_acc: 0.76\n32\t    clean_mean_acc: 0.68\n33\t    theta_shift_15pct: 0.25\n34\t    theta_shift_50pct: 0.42\n35\t    seen_unseen_lz_gap_15pct: 2.8\n36\t  result_rationale: 'Median 档下 Qwen 作为首个测试家族表现中等偏上。|d|=2.50 @ 15% 处于 median 范围 [1.0,\n37\t    2.5] 上端， 因为 MMLU 是最大 benchmark（14K items），person-fit power 最强。 50% 条件 d=0.95（borderline\n38\t    large）反映 θ-shift confound——污染提升 θ_MLE 吸收了部分 aberrance 信号， 导致 free-θ 下 dose-response\n39\t    非单调。clean-vs-clean Δ=0.7 建立 noise floor（远小于 contam Δ）， 确认信号非随机波动。memorization_fraction=0.35\n40\t    落在 median 范围 [0.25, 0.45] 中部—— QLoRA SFT 不完全记忆，约 35% 污染 items 产生记忆信号，其余被 generalization\n41\t    平滑。 seen/unseen gap=2.8 是最清晰的 fingerprint：被污染 items 的 lz* 显著低于 unseen items。 只有\n42\t    2 个 clean seeds（n=2）限制了 Cohen''s d 的精度，motivates 第三个 seed。\n43\t\n44\t    '\n45\t  tables:\n46\t  - title: 'Table: Pilot Δlz* Summary (Qwen3.5-9B × MMLU)'\n47\t    columns:\n48\t    - condition\n49\t    - lz_star\n50\t    - delta_lz_star\n51\t    - cohens_d\n52\t    - accuracy\n53\t    - theta_mle\n54\t    - memorization_frac\n55\t    rows:\n56\t    - - clean-s1\n57\t      - 8.2\n58\t      - —\n59\t      - —\n60\t      - 0.679\n61\t      - -0.11\n62\t      - —\n63\t    - - clean-s2\n64\t      - 7.5\n65\t      - —\n66\t      - —\n67\t      - 0.681\n68\t      - -0.09\n69\t      - —\n70\t    - - contam-15%\n71\t      - 5.1\n72\t      - -2.75\n73\t      - -2.5\n74\t      - 0.72\n75\t      - 0.14\n76\t      - 0.35\n77\t    - - contam-50%\n78\t      - 6.8\n79\t      - -1.05\n80\t      - -0.95\n81\t      - 0.76\n82\t      - 0.31\n83\t      - 0.28\n84\t  figures_description:\n85\t  - 'Bar chart: clean-s1/s2 vs contam-15/50 lz* 值，error bars from clean seed variance'\n86\t  - 'Scatter: seen items lz* vs unseen items lz* at 15% contamination, showing memorization\n87\t    fingerprint'\n88\t  analysis: 'Go signal confirmed: |d|>2 @ 15%。但 free-θ 非单调性（50% d < 15% d）暴露 θ-shift\n89\t    confound， 需要 θ-fixed 分析。n=2 clean seeds 不足以精确估计 variance，第三 seed 必须追加。 Memorization\n90\t    fraction 0.35 意味着 theoretical power 是 upper bound，adjusted power ≈ 0.35 × theoretical。\n91\t\n92\t    '\n93\t- name: Full Controlled Contamination\n94\t  plan_id: exp-ctrl-contam\n95\t  description: '4 模型 (Qwen3.5-9B, Gemma-4-31B, Llama-3.1-8B, Mistral-7B-v0.3) × 6\n96\t    levels (0/5/10/15/25/50%) × 3 benchmarks (MMLU, GSM8K, HellaSwag)。\n97\t\n98\t    '\n99\t  expected_results:\n100\t    qwen_mmlu_d_15pct: -2.5\n101\t    llama_mmlu_d_15pct: -2.8\n102\t    gemma_mmlu_d_15pct: -1.3\n103\t    mistral_mmlu_d_15pct: -2.2\n104\t    mean_mmlu_d_15pct: -2.2\n105\t    min_mmlu_d_15pct: -1.3\n106\t    n_families_d_gt_2_mmlu: 3\n107\t    qwen_hellaswag_d_15pct: -1.2\n108\t    llama_hellaswag_d_15pct: -1.4\n109\t    gemma_hellaswag_d_15pct: -0.6\n110\t    mistral_hellaswag_d_15pct: -1.1\n111\t    mean_hellaswag_d_15pct: -1.08\n112\t    qwen_gsm8k_d_15pct: -0.9\n113\t    llama_gsm8k_d_15pct: -1.1\n114\t    gemma_gsm8k_d_15pct: -0.4\n115\t    mistral_gsm8k_d_15pct: -0.8\n116\t    mean_gsm8k_d_15pct: -0.8\n117\t    theta_fixed_monotonic_families_mmlu: 3\n118\t    theta_fixed_monotonic_families_hellaswag: 2\n119\t    theta_fixed_monotonic_families_gsm8k: 2\n120\t    theta_fixed_non_monotonic_family: Gemma (residual non-monotonicity at 50%)\n121\t    memorization_fraction_mmlu_range:\n122\t    - 0.28\n123\t    - 0.42\n124\t    memorization_fraction_hellaswag_range:\n125\t    - 0.25\n126\t    - 0.38\n127\t    memorization_fraction_gsm8k_range:\n128\t    - 0.22\n129\t    - 0.35\n130\t    n_families_any_benchmark_d_gt_2: 3\n131\t    weakest_family: Gemma\n132\t    weakest_family_reason: high baseline ability → smaller θ-shift, lower aberrance\n133\t      signal\n134\t  result_rationale: 'Median 档核心假设：3/4 家族 |d|>2.0 @ 15% on MMLU，1 家族（Gemma）信号较弱。 Gemma-4-31B\n135\t    作为 31B 模型，baseline ability 高于其他 7-9B 模型，θ_MLE 已较高， contamination 产生的 θ-shift 相对较小，且高能力模型本身对\n136\t    MMLU hard items 答对率就高， memorization 信号被 genuine ability 遮盖——这是 median 档的典型 boundary\n137\t    condition。 HellaSwag（~10K items）d 值在 [0.8, 1.5] 范围，GSM8K（~1.3K items）d 值在 [0.5,\n138\t    1.2] 范围， 严格遵循 power ∝ √n_items 的理论预测——n_items 减小直接压低 lz* 的 signal-to-noise ratio。\n139\t    θ-fixed 在 Qwen/Llama/Mistral 恢复单调性，但 Gemma 因 baseline misfit 较低 + 高 ability， θ-fixed\n140\t    改善有限，50% 条件仍有残余非单调性。 Memorization fraction 家族间有差异（25-45%），反映不同架构的 SFT generalization\n141\t    特性不同： Gemma 的 instruction tuning 基础更强，generalization 更好，记忆信号更弱。\n142\t\n143\t    '\n144\t  tables:\n145\t  - title: 'Table: Cohen''s d @ 15% Contamination (n=3 seeds, ddof=1, ℓz*-corrected)'\n146\t    columns:\n147\t    - family\n148\t    - MMLU_d\n149\t    - HellaSwag_d\n150\t    - GSM8K_d\n151\t    - θ_fixed_monotonic\n152\t    rows:\n153\t    - - Qwen3.5-9B\n154\t      - -2.5\n155\t      - -1.2\n156\t      - -0.9\n157\t      - 'Yes'\n158\t    - - Llama-3.1-8B\n159\t      - -2.8\n160\t      - -1.4\n161\t      - -1.1\n162\t      - 'Yes'\n163\t    - - Gemma-4-31B\n164\t      - -1.3\n165\t      - -0.6\n166\t      - -0.4\n167\t      - No (50% residual)\n168\t    - - Mistral-7B-v0.3\n169\t      - -2.2\n170\t      - -1.1\n171\t      - -0.8\n172\t      - 'Yes'\n173\t    - - Mean\n174\t      - -2.2\n175\t      - -1.08\n176\t      - -0.8\n177\t      - 3/4\n178\t  - title: 'Table: Memorization Fraction by Family × Benchmark'\n179\t    columns:\n180\t    - family\n181\t    - MMLU\n182\t    - HellaSwag\n183\t    - GSM8K\n184\t    rows:\n185\t    - - Qwen3.5-9B\n186\t      - 0.38\n187\t      - 0.33\n188\t      - 0.3\n189\t    - - Llama-3.1-8B\n190\t      - 0.42\n191\t      - 0.38\n192\t      - 0.35\n193\t    - - Gemma-4-31B\n194\t      - 0.28\n195\t      - 0.25\n196\t      - 0.22\n197\t    - - Mistral-7B-v0.3\n198\t      - 0.36\n199\t      - 0.32\n200\t      - 0.28\n201\t  - title: 'Table: Dose-Response (MMLU, θ-fixed, ℓz*-corrected)'\n202\t    columns:\n203\t    - family\n204\t    - d_5pct\n205\t    - d_10pct\n206\t    - d_15pct\n207\t    - d_25pct\n208\t    - d_50pct\n209\t    - monotonic\n210\t    rows:\n211\t    - - Qwen3.5-9B\n212\t      - -0.6\n213\t      - -1.4\n214\t      - -2.5\n215\t      - -3.8\n216\t      - -5.2\n217\t      - 'Yes'\n218\t    - - Llama-3.1-8B\n219\t      - -0.75\n220\t      - -1.6\n221\t      - -2.8\n222\t      - -4.2\n223\t      - -5.8\n224\t      - 'Yes'\n225\t    - - Gemma-4-31B\n226\t      - -0.3\n227\t      - -0.7\n228\t      - -1.3\n229\t      - -1.8\n230\t      - -1.6\n231\t      - 'No'\n232\t    - - Mistral-7B-v0.3\n233\t      - -0.55\n234\t      - -1.2\n235\t      - -2.2\n236\t      - -3.4\n237\t      - -4.6\n238\t      - 'Yes'\n239\t  figures_description:\n240\t  - 'Fig: 4×3 panel dose-response curves (family × benchmark), θ-fixed, with 95% bootstrap\n241\t    CIs'\n242\t  - 'Fig: Memorization fraction heatmap (family × benchmark × contamination level)'\n243\t  - 'Fig: seen/unseen accuracy split at 15% for all 4 families on MMLU'\n244\t  analysis: '3/4 家族 MMLU |d|>2.0 确认检测框架跨家族有效，但 Gemma 的 boundary condition 需在论文中显式报告。\n245\t    HellaSwag/GSM8K 的较低 d 值符合 power ∝ √n_items 理论，strengthens Claim 2。 Gemma 的残余非单调性是\n246\t    median 档的 key limitation——需在 §6 讨论模型 ability 对检测的调制效应。 跨 benchmark memorization\n247\t    fraction 差异表明 SFT generalization 是 benchmark-dependent 的， 支持 Claim 2 的 caveat（power\n248\t    function 是 upper bound）。\n249\t\n250\t    '\n251\t- name: Leaderboard Audit\n252\t  plan_id: exp-leaderboard-audit\n253\t  description: 'Open LLM Leaderboard v1 大规模 person-fit 扫描。已 ABANDONED（D011: a_r=0.111）。\n254\t\n255\t    '\n256\t  expected_results:\n257\t    status: ABANDONED\n258\t    reason: v1-irt-refit a_r=0.111, item alignment 54.56% → parameters too degraded\n259\t      for audit\n260\t  result_rationale: 'Path D 已确认 dead：MML-EM 重拟合的 discrimination 参数 a_r=0.111 远低于 0.2\n261\t    可用阈值， 意味着 v1 leaderboard 参数下的 lz* 基本退化为 accuracy-like statistic， 无法提供 person-fit\n262\t    特有的 response-pattern-level 信息。 在 median 档下不需要尝试——这是一个已被充分验证的 negative result。\n263\t    数据可用性（13K+ models）写入 Discussion/Future Work 即可。\n264\t\n265\t    '\n266\t  tables: []\n267\t  figures_description: []\n268\t  analysis: 'ABANDONED。在论文 §7 Discussion 中报告：13K+ per-item data publicly available，\n269\t    但 current IRT estimation methods 的 sample size requirements 限制了大规模审计。 Frame as\n270\t    \"the gap between classical IRT and neural IRT estimation\" methodological contribution。\n271\t\n272\t    '\n273\t- name: Natural Experiment (base→chat pairs)\n274\t  plan_id: exp-natural-experiment\n275\t  description: 'v1 leaderboard base→chat 模型 pairs，计算 Δlz* 作为 SFT 效应代理。\n276\t\n277\t    '\n278\t  expected_results:\n279\t    n_pairs: 4\n280\t    n_benchmarks: 4\n281\t    n_significant_benchmarks: 1\n282\t    significant_benchmark: HellaSwag\n283\t    hellaswag_mean_delta: -2.8\n284\t    hellaswag_p_value: 0.04\n285\t    mmlu_p_value: 0.22\n286\t    gsm8k_p_value: 0.18\n287\t    arc_c_p_value: 0.45\n288\t    individual_outlier_pairs: 0\n289\t    overall_conclusion: weak_systematic_signal\n290\t  result_rationale: 'Median 档下 natural experiment 受限于两个因素： (1) a_r=0.111 使 lz* 退化为\n291\t    accuracy-like，个体 Δlz* 主要反映 Δaccuracy 而非 response pattern shift； (2) 仅 4-5 usable\n292\t    pairs 无统计检验能力（n 太小无法做 paired t-test with power）。 HellaSwag 可能显示 marginal significance\n293\t    因为它是最大的非 MMLU benchmark（~10K items）， 但 effect 不强。其他 benchmarks p>0.15。无个体 outlier\n294\t    pair 显示 benchmark-specific contamination。 这是一个 P2-optional 实验，median 档下结论是 \"suggestive\n295\t    but underpowered\"， 不进入主论文 claims，可在 appendix 报告。\n296\t\n297\t    '\n298\t  tables:\n299\t  - title: 'Table: Natural Experiment Δlz* (base→chat)'\n300\t    columns:\n301\t    - benchmark\n302\t    - n_pairs\n303\t    - mean_delta\n304\t    - t_stat\n305\t    - p_value\n306\t    - significant\n307\t    rows:\n308\t    - - MMLU\n309\t      - 4\n310\t      - -1.2\n311\t      - -1.45\n312\t      - 0.22\n313\t      - 'No'\n314\t    - - HellaSwag\n315\t      - 4\n316\t      - -2.8\n317\t      - -2.85\n318\t      - 0.04\n319\t      - Marginal\n320\t    - - GSM8K\n321\t      - 4\n322\t      - 1.5\n323\t      - 1.62\n324\t      - 0.18\n325\t      - 'No'\n326\t    - - ARC-C\n327\t      - 4\n328\t      - -0.6\n329\t      - -0.82\n330\t      - 0.45\n331\t      - 'No'\n332\t  figures_description:\n333\t  - 'Paired dot plot: base vs chat lz* per pair, by benchmark'\n334\t  analysis: 'Underpowered by design (n=4 pairs, a_r degraded)。HellaSwag marginal significance\n335\t    可能反映 SFT 的系统效应而非 contamination。不影响论文 claims。 Appendix material，mention in §6 as\n336\t    \"preliminary evidence consistent with SFT effects on response patterns\"。\n337\t\n338\t    '\n339\t- name: v1 IRT Refit Expanded\n340\t  plan_id: exp-v1-irt-refit-expanded\n341\t  description: '扩大 v1 IRT 重拟合至 N≥500，验证 pilot N=63 的 a_r=0.111 是否因样本量不足。\n342\t\n343\t    '\n344\t  expected_results:\n345\t    n_models_downloaded: 520\n346\t    n_models_usable: 410\n347\t    a_r_3pl: 0.13\n348\t    a_r_2pl: -0.02\n349\t    b_r_3pl: 0.66\n350\t    b_r_spearman: 0.68\n351\t    fitting_time_sec: 180\n352\t    conclusion: negative_path_d_dead\n353\t  result_rationale: 'Median 档预期 a_r 从 0.111（N=63）仅微升至 ~0.13（N=500+），远低于 0.2 可用阈值。\n354\t    原因：discrimination failure 不是 sample size 问题，而是 LLM response patterns 的结构性特征——\n355\t    classical IRT 假设 unidimensional latent trait，但 LLMs 的 ability profile 是 multi-dimensional\n356\t    的 （不同 domain 能力独立变化），导致 item discrimination 在 aggregate 拟合中坍缩。 b_r 稳定在 0.66（difficulty\n357\t    恢复尚可）进一步确认：问题在 discrimination 而非 difficulty。 这个 negative result 是 methodological\n358\t    contribution——量化了 classical vs neural IRT 的 sample size gap。 N=500 满足 reviewer\n359\t    要求的阈值，可以最终关闭 Path D。\n360\t\n361\t    '\n362\t  tables:\n363\t  - title: 'Table: IRT Refit Comparison (pilot vs expanded)'\n364\t    columns:\n365\t    - metric\n366\t    - pilot_N63\n367\t    - expanded_N500\n368\t    - threshold\n369\t    - verdict\n370\t    rows:\n371\t    - - 3PL a_r (Pearson)\n372\t      - 0.111\n373\t      - 0.13\n374\t      - '>0.4 viable'\n375\t      - FAIL\n376\t    - - 2PL a_r (Pearson)\n377\t      - -0.084\n378\t      - -0.02\n379\t      - '>0.4 viable'\n380\t      - FAIL\n381\t    - - 3PL b_r (Pearson)\n382\t      - 0.626\n383\t      - 0.66\n384\t      - '>0.5 viable'\n385\t      - PASS\n386\t    - - 3PL b_r (Spearman)\n387\t      - 0.656\n388\t      - 0.68\n389\t      - '>0.5 viable'\n390\t      - PASS\n391\t  figures_description:\n392\t  - 'Scatter: PSN-IRT a vs v1-refit a (N=500), showing collapsed discrimination'\n393\t  analysis: 'Path D 最终关闭。a_r<0.2 at N=500 confirms discrimination failure is structural,\n394\t    not sample-size-driven。 论文 §5 报告为 \"IRT parameter estimation challenges\"（Claim\n395\t    3c）， framing: \"the gap between classical psychometric sample requirements and\n396\t    the scale needed for neural IRT\"。\n397\t\n398\t    '\n399\t- name: 4PL vs 3PL Ablation\n400\t  plan_id: exp-4pl-ablation\n401\t  description: '比较 4PL vs 3PL(d=1) 下的检测灵敏度差异，量化 feasibility parameter d 的影响。\n402\t\n403\t    '\n404\t  expected_results:\n405\t    far_4pl: 0.05\n406\t    far_3pl_range:\n407\t    - 0.06\n408\t    - 0.14\n409\t    far_2pl_range:\n410\t    - 0.5\n411\t    - 1.0\n412\t    mean_power_gain_mmlu: 0.22\n413\t    mean_power_gain_hellaswag: 0.2\n414\t    mean_power_gain_gsm8k: 0.16\n415\t    mean_power_gain_arc_c: 0.11\n416\t    mean_power_gain_humaneval: 0.1\n417\t    pct_items_d_lt_0.95_mmlu: 0.46\n418\t    correlation_4pl_3pl_lz: 0.35\n419\t  result_rationale: 'Median 档预期 4PL 相对 3PL 的 power gain 在 +15-25pp 范围（略低于 optimistic\n420\t    的 +25-30pp）。 原因：46% MMLU items 有 d<0.95（从已有 PSN-IRT 参数已知），这些 items 的 upper asymptote\n421\t    <1， high-ability models 在这些 items 上即使全对也不会产生极端 aberrance。 3PL(d=1) 强制 upper asymptote=1，对\n422\t    high-ability models 系统性高估 expected P(correct)， 导致 false alarm inflation（6-14%）和\n423\t    lz* 偏移。 相关性 r=0.35 表明 4PL vs 3PL lz* 存在根本性差异，不是简单缩放关系。 2PL 完全不可用（FAR 50-100%）因为同时忽略了\n424\t    guessing 和 upper asymptote。 这个 ablation 直接支持 method design choice 的合理性。\n425\t\n426\t    '\n427\t  tables:\n428\t  - title: 'Table: Detection Power at 25% Contamination by Model'\n429\t    columns:\n430\t    - benchmark\n431\t    - power_4PL\n432\t    - power_3PL\n433\t    - gain_pp\n434\t    - pct_items_d_lt_0.95\n435\t    rows:\n436\t    - - MMLU\n437\t      - 0.72\n438\t      - 0.5\n439\t      - 22\n440\t      - 46%\n441\t    - - HellaSwag\n442\t      - 0.48\n443\t      - 0.28\n444\t      - 20\n445\t      - 41%\n446\t    - - GSM8K\n447\t      - 0.65\n448\t      - 0.49\n449\t      - 16\n450\t      - 30%\n451\t    - - ARC-C\n452\t      - 0.12\n453\t      - 0.08\n454\t      - 4\n455\t      - 22%\n456\t    - - HumanEval\n457\t      - 0.28\n458\t      - 0.18\n459\t      - 10\n460\t      - 35%\n461\t  figures_description:\n462\t  - 'Paired power curves: 4PL vs 3PL across contamination levels for each benchmark'\n463\t  - Histogram of d parameter distribution across MMLU items, annotated with d=0.95\n464\t    threshold\n465\t  analysis: '4PL d parameter 对 LLM contamination detection 不可或缺。 Power gain +15-25pp\n466\t    在论文中用 one sentence 总结即可： \"Ignoring the upper asymptote parameter halves detection\n467\t    power on benchmarks with substantial d<0.95 items.\" 2PL 的灾难性 FAR 作为 negative control\n468\t    报告，确认 guessing parameter 同样必要。\n469\t\n470\t    '\n471\t- name: Baseline Comparison\n472\t  plan_id: exp-baseline-comparison\n473\t  description: '≥5 baselines 在 ctrl-contam ground-truth 上对比： IRT-FIT, ConStat, Min-K%++,\n474\t    accuracy z-score, PPL-based, random。\n475\t\n476\t    '\n477\t  expected_results:\n478\t    auroc_5pct:\n479\t      lz_star: 0.65\n480\t      accuracy_zscore: 0.53\n481\t      mink_pp: 0.78\n482\t      constat: 0.72\n483\t      ppl_based: 0.75\n484\t      random: 0.5\n485\t    auroc_10pct:\n486\t      lz_star: 0.74\n487\t      accuracy_zscore: 0.58\n488\t      mink_pp: 0.86\n489\t      constat: 0.82\n490\t      ppl_based: 0.83\n491\t      random: 0.5\n492\t    auroc_15pct:\n493\t      lz_star: 0.8\n494\t      accuracy_zscore: 0.62\n495\t      mink_pp: 0.92\n496\t      constat: 0.88\n497\t      ppl_based: 0.9\n498\t      random: 0.5\n499\t    auroc_25pct:\n500\t      lz_star: 0.86\n501\t      accuracy_zscore: 0.7\n502\t      mink_pp: 0.96\n503\t      constat: 0.93\n504\t      ppl_based: 0.95\n505\t      random: 0.5\n506\t    auroc_gap_at_5pct_vs_best: -0.13\n507\t    auroc_gap_at_15pct_vs_best: -0.12\n508\t    auroc_gap_at_25pct_vs_best: -0.1\n509\t    lz_star_ci_width_15pct: 0.06\n510\t    mink_pp_ci_width_15pct: 0.04\n511\t    lz_star_rank_at_5pct: 2nd (behind Min-K%++)\n512\t    lz_star_rank_at_15pct: 4th\n513\t    lz_star_beats_accuracy_zscore_all_levels: true\n514\t    information_access:\n515\t      lz_star: binary only\n516\t      accuracy_zscore: binary only\n517\t      mink_pp: token probs\n518\t      constat: retest\n519\t      ppl_based: log-probs\n520\t      random: none\n521\t  result_rationale: \"Median 档核心：lz* 在 5% 低污染区间优势明确（0.65 vs accuracy_zscore 0.53，+0.12），\\\n522\t    \\ 但 15%+ 区间落后于 Min-K%++/ConStat 10-15% AUROC。 原因分析： (1) lz* @ 5% 优于 accuracy z-score\\\n523\t    \\ 因为它利用了 response pattern 的 item-level 信息（IRT inductive bias），\\n    而 accuracy\\\n524\t    \\ z-score 只看 aggregate score；\\n(2) lz* @ 5% 接近 privileged methods（gap 仅 -0.13）因为低污染下\\\n525\t    \\ privileged methods 的信号也弱，\\n    lz* 的 IRT structure 作为 inductive bias 部分补偿了 information\\\n526\t    \\ disadvantage；\\n(3) @ 15%+ lz* 落后因为 privileged methods 获得的额外信息（token probs, retest）\\n\\\n527\t    \\    提供了 lz* 无法获取的 fine-grained signal，信息差距随污染增加而放大；\\n(4) AUROC gap [-0.15, -0.05]\\\n528\t    \\ 在 median 范围，诚实但不灾难性。 narrative 策略：plot information-access vs detection-power\\\n529\t    \\ frontier curve， 强调 lz* 定义了 \\\"minimal-information operating point\\\" 的价值而非绝对性能。\\n\"\n530\t  tables:\n531\t  - title: 'Table: AUROC Comparison Across Contamination Levels (MMLU, mean ± 95%\n532\t      CI)'\n533\t    columns:\n534\t    - method\n535\t    - info_access\n536\t    - 5%\n537\t    - 10%\n538\t    - 15%\n539\t    - 25%\n540\t    rows:\n541\t    - - Random\n542\t      - —\n543\t      - '0.50'\n544\t      - '0.50'\n545\t      - '0.50'\n546\t      - '0.50'\n547\t    - - Acc z-score\n548\t      - binary\n549\t      - 0.53±0.05\n550\t      - 0.58±0.05\n551\t      - 0.62±0.05\n552\t      - 0.70±0.04\n553\t    - - lz* (ours)\n554\t      - binary\n555\t      - 0.65±0.06\n556\t      - 0.74±0.06\n557\t      - 0.80±0.06\n558\t      - 0.86±0.05\n559\t    - - ConStat\n560\t      - retest\n561\t      - 0.72±0.04\n562\t      - 0.82±0.04\n563\t      - 0.88±0.04\n564\t      - 0.93±0.03\n565\t    - - PPL-based\n566\t      - log-probs\n567\t      - 0.75±0.04\n568\t      - 0.83±0.04\n569\t      - 0.90±0.03\n570\t      - 0.95±0.02\n571\t    - - Min-K%++\n572\t      - token probs\n573\t      - 0.78±0.04\n574\t      - 0.86±0.03\n575\t      - 0.92±0.03\n576\t      - 0.96±0.02\n577\t  - title: 'Table: Information-Access vs Detection-Power Summary'\n578\t    columns:\n579\t    - operating_point\n580\t    - methods\n581\t    - AUROC_15pct_range\n582\t    - information_required\n583\t    rows:\n584\t    - - Minimal\n585\t      - lz*, acc z-score\n586\t      - 0.62-0.80\n587\t      - Binary response pattern only\n588\t    - - Moderate\n589\t      - ConStat\n590\t      - '0.88'\n591\t      - Retest with rephrased items\n592\t    - - Full\n593\t      - Min-K%++, PPL\n594\t      - 0.90-0.92\n595\t      - Token-level probabilities\n596\t  figures_description:\n597\t  - 'Fig: Detection frontier — x-axis: information access level (categorical), y-axis:\n598\t    AUROC, one curve per contamination level'\n599\t  - 'Fig: ROC curves at 15% contamination for all 6 methods, with 95% bootstrap CIs\n600\t    as shaded bands'\n601\t  - 'Fig: AUROC vs contamination level curves, showing lz* crossing accuracy z-score\n602\t    early and converging toward privileged methods'\n603\t  analysis: '关键叙事：lz* 是 minimal-information frontier 的 champion——在 binary-only 条件下显著优于\n604\t    accuracy z-score， 且在低污染区间接近 privileged methods。15%+ 的 gap 是 information disadvantage\n605\t    的直接后果，不是 method failure。 Bootstrap CIs 是论文的差异化优势（6/8 peer papers 不报告 variance）。\n606\t    Detection frontier figure 是 paper 的 key contribution visualization。\n607\t\n608\t    '\n609\t- name: Multiscale lzm Statistic\n610\t  plan_id: exp-multiscale-lzm\n611\t  description: '实现 Hong, Lin & Cheng (2021) multiscale lzm——跨 benchmark 聚合的标准化 lz*\n612\t    总分。\n613\t\n614\t    '\n615\t  expected_results:\n616\t    lzm_gemini15: 45.2\n617\t    lzm_vs_per_benchmark_correlation: 0.92\n618\t    lzm_improvement_over_avg_lz: marginal\n619\t    n_newly_flagged: 0\n620\t    n_newly_unflagged: 0\n621\t    lzm_flagged_rate: 57/60 (same as per-benchmark)\n622\t    lzm_interpretability: lower than per-benchmark (loses benchmark-specific patterns)\n623\t  result_rationale: 'Median 档下 lzm 提供 marginal improvement：由于 LLM data 已经 universally\n624\t    flagged（57/60）， 聚合统计量无法进一步区分。r=0.92 表明 lzm 与 avg(lz*) 高度相关，额外信息有限。 更重要的是，per-benchmark\n625\t    lz* profile 是 contamination characterization 的核心 （如 Gemini 的 selective vs uniform\n626\t    misfit），而 lzm 聚合丢失了这些 benchmark-specific patterns。 在 median 档下 lzm 是 nice-to-have\n627\t    但不改变任何 claim，可降为 appendix。\n628\t\n629\t    '\n630\t  tables:\n631\t  - title: 'Table: lzm vs Per-Benchmark lz* for Top Anomalous Models'\n632\t    columns:\n633\t    - model\n634\t    - lzm\n635\t    - mmlu_lz\n636\t    - hellaswag_lz\n637\t    - gsm8k_lz\n638\t    - pattern\n639\t    rows:\n640\t    - - Gemini-1.5\n641\t      - 45.2\n642\t      - 31.8\n643\t      - -12.3\n644\t      - -8.5\n645\t      - Selective (MMLU+, others-)\n646\t    - - Yi-Lightning\n647\t      - 52.1\n648\t      - 48.2\n649\t      - 35.1\n650\t      - 22.0\n651\t      - Uniform positive\n652\t    - - Doubao\n653\t      - 18.3\n654\t      - 25.6\n655\t      - -5.2\n656\t      - -10.1\n657\t      - Mixed\n658\t  figures_description:\n659\t  - 'Scatter: lzm vs mean(|per-benchmark lz*|), showing near-linear relationship'\n660\t  analysis: 'lzm 不增加 detection power，但可在 supplementary 中报告为 alternative aggregation。\n661\t    论文主体保留 per-benchmark profile 作为 primary presentation。\n662\t\n663\t    '\n664\t- name: Post-RL Hypothesis Test\n665\t  plan_id: exp-post-rl\n666\t  description: 'Qwen3.5-9B: SFT 污染 → GRPO 训练 → 测试 person-fit 是否保持检测力。\n667\t\n668\t    '\n669\t  expected_results:\n670\t    pre_rl_d_15pct: -2.5\n671\t    post_rl_d_15pct: -1.1\n672\t    signal_retention_ratio: 0.44\n673\t    post_rl_lz_star_contam_15: 6.2\n674\t    post_rl_lz_star_clean: 7.8\n675\t    post_rl_delta_lz: -1.6\n676\t    post_rl_p_value: 0.03\n677\t    post_rl_memorization_fraction: 0.18\n678\t    grpo_training_steps: 2000\n679\t    grpo_reward: rule-based (MMLU accuracy on held-out set)\n680\t    experiment_completed_before_ddl: uncertain\n681\t    wang_mia_post_rl_auroc: 0.52\n682\t    lz_star_post_rl_auroc: 0.62\n683\t  result_rationale: 'Median 档核心假设：post-RL 信号衰减但未消失（|d| 0.5-1.5），或实验未在 DDL 前完成。 预测\n684\t    |d|=1.10（从 pre-RL 2.50 衰减 56%）：GRPO 优化 reward signal 时， RL exploration 部分覆写了 SFT\n685\t    记忆——模型学会了 \"更好的理由\" 来选择答案， 而非依赖记忆的 response pattern。但 binary response 层面的 aberrance\n686\t    不完全消失， 因为 RL 不直接优化 response pattern distribution，只优化 outcome。 memorization_fraction\n687\t    从 pre-RL ~0.35 降至 ~0.18：RL 使约一半的 \"记忆\" items 转化为 \"理解\"。 关键：即使 |d|=1.10 仍然 significant\n688\t    (p=0.03)，而 Wang et al. 证明 MIA methods 完全失效（AUROC≈0.50）。 这就是 binary-level 检测的 structural\n689\t    advantage——RL 改变 token distribution 但不完全消除 aberrant binary patterns。 但 DDL 风险：GRPO\n690\t    训练需要 reward model setup + 调参 + 多 seed validation，40 GPU-hrs 可能不足。 若不完整，降为 Discussion\n691\t    中 \"structural argument + preliminary evidence\"。\n692\t\n693\t    '\n694\t  tables:\n695\t  - title: 'Table: Pre- vs Post-RL Detection (Qwen3.5-9B × MMLU @ 15%)'\n696\t    columns:\n697\t    - condition\n698\t    - lz_star\n699\t    - delta_lz\n700\t    - cohens_d\n701\t    - memorization_frac\n702\t    rows:\n703\t    - - Clean\n704\t      - 7.85\n705\t      - —\n706\t      - —\n707\t      - —\n708\t    - - SFT-contam (pre-RL)\n709\t      - 5.1\n710\t      - -2.75\n711\t      - -2.5\n712\t      - 0.35\n713\t    - - SFT-contam + GRPO (post-RL)\n714\t      - 6.2\n715\t      - -1.6\n716\t      - -1.1\n717\t      - 0.18\n718\t  - title: 'Table: Post-RL Comparison with Wang et al. MIA Methods'\n719\t    columns:\n720\t    - method\n721\t    - info_access\n722\t    - pre_rl_auroc\n723\t    - post_rl_auroc\n724\t    - retention\n725\t    rows:\n726\t    - - lz* (ours)\n727\t      - binary\n728\t      - 0.8\n729\t      - 0.62\n730\t      - 77.5%\n731\t    - - Min-K%++\n732\t      - token probs\n733\t      - 0.92\n734\t      - 0.52\n735\t      - 56.5%\n736\t    - - PPL-based\n737\t      - log-probs\n738\t      - 0.9\n739\t      - 0.51\n740\t      - 56.7%\n741\t  figures_description:\n742\t  - 'Fig: lz* distribution shift: clean vs SFT-contam vs SFT-contam+GRPO, three overlaid\n743\t    histograms'\n744\t  - 'Fig: Detection frontier (info access vs AUROC) at pre-RL and post-RL, showing\n745\t    lz* advantage widens post-RL'\n746\t  analysis: 'Post-RL |d|=1.10 是 medium-to-large effect——信号衰减但 statistically significant。\n747\t    若在 DDL 前完成：strengthens paper 显著（unique contribution: only binary method surviving\n748\t    RL）。 若不完整：降为 Discussion，做 structural argument——\"RL modifies token distributions\n749\t    but not binary patterns directly, so person-fit retains partial signal where MIA-based\n750\t    methods fail completely\"。 无论哪种情况，对 EMNLP 投稿不是 blocking issue。\n751\t\n752\t    '\n753\t- name: Extra Benchmarks (BBH + MATH)\n754\t  plan_id: exp-extra-benchmarks\n755\t  description: 'BBH (6,511 items) 和 MATH (5,000 items) 填充 1K-10K items 的 power gap。\n756\t\n757\t    '\n758\t  expected_results:\n759\t    bbh_power_15pct: 0.68\n760\t    math_power_15pct: 0.55\n761\t    bbh_power_vs_theory: within 5%\n762\t    math_power_vs_theory: within 8%\n763\t    power_theory_R2_with_extras: 0.88\n764\t    bbh_4pl_available: false\n765\t    math_4pl_available: false\n766\t    bbh_4pl_estimation_needed: true\n767\t    math_4pl_estimation_needed: true\n768\t    estimation_gpu_hours: 8\n769\t    estimation_n_models_needed: 50\n770\t  result_rationale: 'Median 档下 BBH (6.5K items) 和 MATH (5K items) 落在 power curve 的\n771\t    \"中等\" 区间： power@15% 预期 0.55-0.68，验证 power ∝ √n_items 理论在 1K-10K 范围的插值。 BBH > MATH\n772\t    因为 n_items 多 30%，strictly following the theoretical relationship。 关键挑战：PSN-IRT\n773\t    可能不包含这些 benchmarks 的 4PL 参数。 如果需要自己估计 4PL，至少需要 50 个模型的 per-item responses + MML-EM\n774\t    fitting， 这引入新的 estimation quality concern（同 Path D 的 a_r 问题）。 Median 档下 R²=0.88（含新\n775\t    benchmarks）略低于 simulation-only 的 0.957， 反映 SFT generalization gap（theoretical\n776\t    power 是 upper bound，actual power 受 memorization fraction 调制）。 这恰好支持 Claim 2 的\n777\t    \"upper bound\" caveat。\n778\t\n779\t    '\n780\t  tables:\n781\t  - title: 'Table: Power Function Validation with Extended Benchmarks'\n782\t    columns:\n783\t    - benchmark\n784\t    - n_items\n785\t    - power_15pct_sim\n786\t    - power_15pct_theory\n787\t    - gap\n788\t    rows:\n789\t    - - HumanEval\n790\t      - 164\n791\t      - 0.24\n792\t      - 0.22\n793\t      - 0.02\n794\t    - - ARC-C\n795\t      - 295\n796\t      - 0.13\n797\t      - 0.15\n798\t      - -0.02\n799\t    - - MATH\n800\t      - 5000\n801\t      - 0.55\n802\t      - 0.58\n803\t      - -0.03\n804\t    - - BBH\n805\t      - 6511\n806\t      - 0.68\n807\t      - 0.72\n808\t      - -0.04\n809\t    - - GSM8K\n810\t      - 1319\n811\t      - 0.59\n812\t      - 0.55\n813\t      - 0.04\n814\t    - - HellaSwag\n815\t      - 10042\n816\t      - 0.75\n817\t      - 0.78\n818\t      - -0.03\n819\t    - - MMLU\n820\t      - 14042\n821\t      - 0.98\n822\t      - 0.98\n823\t      - 0.0\n824\t  figures_description:\n825\t  - 'Fig: Power vs √n_items with 7 benchmarks, theoretical curve overlay, 95% CI bands'\n826\t  analysis: 'BBH/MATH 填补 1K-10K gap，strengthens Claim 2 的 power function。 但若 4PL 参数需自行估计，quality\n827\t    concern 可能引入 noise。 如果 PSN-IRT 不包含这些参数，建议降为 appendix 或 future work。 核心 5 benchmarks\n828\t    已足够支撑 power theory（R²=0.957）。\n829\t\n830\t    '\n831\t- name: Domain-Level Analysis\n832\t  plan_id: exp-domain-analysis\n833\t  description: 'MMLU domain-level person-fit 分析，识别 Gemini-1.5 等模型的 domain-specific\n834\t    污染模式。\n835\t\n836\t    '\n837\t  expected_results:\n838\t    gemini15_all_domains_flagged: true\n839\t    gemini15_domain_concentrated: false\n840\t    gemini15_stem_lz: 22.0\n841\t    gemini15_humanities_lz: 18.5\n842\t    gemini15_social_sciences_lz: 16.2\n843\t    gemini15_other_lz: 15.8\n844\t    n_models_domain_concentrated: 2\n845\t    doubao_pattern: Humanities/SocialSci negative, STEM neutral, Other positive\n846\t    hunyuan_pattern: SocialSci high positive, STEM low\n847\t    domain_entropy_correlation_with_contamination: 0.45\n848\t    n_subjects_total: 57\n849\t    gemini_subjects_flagged: 52\n850\t  result_rationale: \"Median 档下 domain analysis 证实两种 contamination pattern： (1) Uniform\\\n851\t    \\ contamination (Gemini-1.5): 100% accuracy across all domains，\\n    所有 domain\\\n852\t    \\ 都 flagged，STEM 略高因为 STEM items 的 discrimination 通常更高\\n    （item difficulty variance\\\n853\t    \\ 更大），产生更强的 aberrance signal。\\n(2) Selective contamination (Doubao, Hunyuan):\\\n854\t    \\ domain-specific misfit patterns，\\n    某些 domain positive lz*（over-consistent，可能是\\\n855\t    \\ domain-specific training data exposure），\\n    某些 domain negative lz*（aberrant，可能是\\\n856\t    \\ domain mismatch）。\\nDomain entropy 与 contamination severity 的 moderate correlation\\\n857\t    \\ (r=0.45) 表明 更均匀的 domain misfit 通常伴随更高的整体 contamination 程度——但不是强关系， 因为 SFT 的\\\n858\t    \\ generalization 跨 domain 不均匀。\\n\"\n859\t  tables:\n860\t  - title: 'Table: Domain-Level lz* for Selected Models'\n861\t    columns:\n862\t    - model\n863\t    - STEM\n864\t    - Humanities\n865\t    - Social_Sci\n866\t    - Other\n867\t    - pattern_type\n868\t    rows:\n869\t    - - Gemini-1.5\n870\t      - 22.0\n871\t      - 18.5\n872\t      - 16.2\n873\t      - 15.8\n874\t      - Uniform positive\n875\t    - - Yi-Lightning\n876\t      - 50.1\n877\t      - 45.3\n878\t      - 48.7\n879\t      - 42.0\n880\t      - Uniform positive (extreme)\n881\t    - - Doubao\n882\t      - -2.0\n883\t      - -13.0\n884\t      - -14.8\n885\t      - 4.4\n886\t      - Selective mixed\n887\t    - - Hunyuan\n888\t      - 1.8\n889\t      - 8.2\n890\t      - 13.9\n891\t      - 6.5\n892\t      - Selective positive\n893\t    - - Mistral-Large\n894\t      - 28.5\n895\t      - 24.1\n896\t      - 22.0\n897\t      - 20.3\n898\t      - Uniform positive\n899\t  figures_description:\n900\t  - 'Heatmap: models (rows) × MMLU domains (cols), color = lz*, with Ward clustering\n901\t    dendrogram'\n902\t  - 'Radar chart: 4 selected models'' domain-level lz* profiles, overlaid'\n903\t  analysis: Domain analysis 是 Claim 3 的 supporting evidence：contamination 不仅可以检测，\n904\t    还可以 characterize（uniform vs selective patterns）。 Ward clustering 可能 reveal contamination\n905\t    typology（2-3 clusters）， 为 \"Detection and Characterization\" 标题提供直接支撑。 建议作为 §5 case\n906\t    study 的 subsection 呈现。\n907\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"a480c752-824a-4b95-b649-1e3dd1903467","uuid":"89365d8b-c340-4fdf-a837-3af9718cf97a","timestamp":"2026-05-21T04:10:04.707Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-be-idea-gen-0519-3/projects/irt_personfit_contam/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260521T032820/median/review_context.yaml","content":"narrative_guidance: 'Claim 1 调整为 \"principled detection framework with characterized\n  operating conditions\"： 检测在 3/4 家族有效（|d|>2.0 @ 15%），1 家族信号较弱（|d| 1.0-2.0）。 HellaSwag/GSM8K\n  效果显著但 d 值受 n_items 制约。θ-fixed 在多数家族恢复单调性但非全部。 Baseline 对比诚实报告 information-access\n  vs detection-power tradeoff，强调 minimal-information operating point 价值。 Post-RL 若不完整降为\n  Discussion 中 structural argument + preliminary evidence。 标题可调整为 \"Detection and Characterization\n  of Benchmark Contamination via IRT Person-Fit\"。\n\n  '\nimagined_experiments:\n- name: Controlled Contamination Pilot\n  plan_id: exp-ctrl-contam-pilot\n  description: 'Qwen3.5-9B × MMLU, 4 conditions (0%-s1/0%-s2/15%/50%)。 Go/no-go 信号：Δlz*\n    是否显著，clean-vs-clean noise floor，memorization fraction。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    clean_s1_lz_star: 8.2\n    clean_s2_lz_star: 7.5\n    clean_mean_lz_star: 7.85\n    clean_std_lz_star: 0.49\n    contam_15_lz_star: 5.1\n    contam_50_lz_star: 6.8\n    contam_15_delta_lz_star: -2.75\n    contam_50_delta_lz_star: -1.05\n    cohens_d_contam_15: -2.5\n    cohens_d_contam_50: -0.95\n    clean_vs_clean_delta: 0.7\n    memorization_fraction_15pct: 0.35\n    memorization_fraction_50pct: 0.28\n    contam_15_acc: 0.72\n    contam_50_acc: 0.76\n    clean_mean_acc: 0.68\n    theta_shift_15pct: 0.25\n    theta_shift_50pct: 0.42\n    seen_unseen_lz_gap_15pct: 2.8\n  result_rationale: 'Median 档下 Qwen 作为首个测试家族表现中等偏上。|d|=2.50 @ 15% 处于 median 范围 [1.0,\n    2.5] 上端， 因为 MMLU 是最大 benchmark（14K items），person-fit power 最强。 50% 条件 d=0.95（borderline\n    large）反映 θ-shift confound——污染提升 θ_MLE 吸收了部分 aberrance 信号， 导致 free-θ 下 dose-response\n    非单调。clean-vs-clean Δ=0.7 建立 noise floor（远小于 contam Δ）， 确认信号非随机波动。memorization_fraction=0.35\n    落在 median 范围 [0.25, 0.45] 中部—— QLoRA SFT 不完全记忆，约 35% 污染 items 产生记忆信号，其余被 generalization\n    平滑。 seen/unseen gap=2.8 是最清晰的 fingerprint：被污染 items 的 lz* 显著低于 unseen items。 只有\n    2 个 clean seeds（n=2）限制了 Cohen''s d 的精度，motivates 第三个 seed。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - title: 'Table: Pilot Δlz* Summary (Qwen3.5-9B × MMLU)'\n    columns:\n    - condition\n    - lz_star\n    - delta_lz_star\n    - cohens_d\n    - accuracy\n    - theta_mle\n    - memorization_frac\n    rows:\n    - - clean-s1\n      - 8.2\n      - —\n      - —\n      - 0.679\n      - -0.11\n      - —\n    - - clean-s2\n      - 7.5\n      - —\n      - —\n      - 0.681\n      - -0.09\n      - —\n    - - contam-15%\n      - 5.1\n      - -2.75\n      - -2.5\n      - 0.72\n      - 0.14\n      - 0.35\n    - - contam-50%\n      - 6.8\n      - -1.05\n      - -0.95\n      - 0.76\n      - 0.31\n      - 0.28\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Bar chart: clean-s1/s2 vs contam-15/50 lz* 值，error bars from clean seed variance'\n  - 'Scatter: seen items lz* vs unseen items lz* at 15% contamination, showing memorization\n    fingerprint'\n  analysis: 'Go signal confirmed: |d|>2 @ 15%。但 free-θ 非单调性（50% d < 15% d）暴露 θ-shift\n    confound， 需要 θ-fixed 分析。n=2 clean seeds 不足以精确估计 variance，第三 seed 必须追加。 Memorization\n    fraction 0.35 意味着 theoretical power 是 upper bound，adjusted power ≈ 0.35 × theoretical。\n\n    '\n- name: Full Controlled Contamination\n  plan_id: exp-ctrl-contam\n  description: '4 模型 (Qwen3.5-9B, Gemma-4-31B, Llama-3.1-8B, Mistral-7B-v0.3) × 6\n    levels (0/5/10/15/25/50%) × 3 benchmarks (MMLU, GSM8K, HellaSwag)。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    qwen_mmlu_d_15pct: -2.5\n    llama_mmlu_d_15pct: -2.8\n    gemma_mmlu_d_15pct: -1.3\n    mistral_mmlu_d_15pct: -2.2\n    mean_mmlu_d_15pct: -2.2\n    min_mmlu_d_15pct: -1.3\n    n_families_d_gt_2_mmlu: 3\n    qwen_hellaswag_d_15pct: -1.2\n    llama_hellaswag_d_15pct: -1.4\n    gemma_hellaswag_d_15pct: -0.6\n    mistral_hellaswag_d_15pct: -1.1\n    mean_hellaswag_d_15pct: -1.08\n    qwen_gsm8k_d_15pct: -0.9\n    llama_gsm8k_d_15pct: -1.1\n    gemma_gsm8k_d_15pct: -0.4\n    mistral_gsm8k_d_15pct: -0.8\n    mean_gsm8k_d_15pct: -0.8\n    theta_fixed_monotonic_families_mmlu: 3\n    theta_fixed_monotonic_families_hellaswag: 2\n    theta_fixed_monotonic_families_gsm8k: 2\n    theta_fixed_non_monotonic_family: Gemma (residual non-monotonicity at 50%)\n    memorization_fraction_mmlu_range:\n    - 0.28\n    - 0.42\n    memorization_fraction_hellaswag_range:\n    - 0.25\n    - 0.38\n    memorization_fraction_gsm8k_range:\n    - 0.22\n    - 0.35\n    n_families_any_benchmark_d_gt_2: 3\n    weakest_family: Gemma\n    weakest_family_reason: high baseline ability → smaller θ-shift, lower aberrance\n      signal\n  result_rationale: 'Median 档核心假设：3/4 家族 |d|>2.0 @ 15% on MMLU，1 家族（Gemma）信号较弱。 Gemma-4-31B\n    作为 31B 模型，baseline ability 高于其他 7-9B 模型，θ_MLE 已较高， contamination 产生的 θ-shift 相对较小，且高能力模型本身对\n    MMLU hard items 答对率就高， memorization 信号被 genuine ability 遮盖——这是 median 档的典型 boundary\n    condition。 HellaSwag（~10K items）d 值在 [0.8, 1.5] 范围，GSM8K（~1.3K items）d 值在 [0.5,\n    1.2] 范围， 严格遵循 power ∝ √n_items 的理论预测——n_items 减小直接压低 lz* 的 signal-to-noise ratio。\n    θ-fixed 在 Qwen/Llama/Mistral 恢复单调性，但 Gemma 因 baseline misfit 较低 + 高 ability， θ-fixed\n    改善有限，50% 条件仍有残余非单调性。 Memorization fraction 家族间有差异（25-45%），反映不同架构的 SFT generalization\n    特性不同： Gemma 的 instruction tuning 基础更强，generalization 更好，记忆信号更弱。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - title: 'Table: Cohen''s d @ 15% Contamination (n=3 seeds, ddof=1, ℓz*-corrected)'\n    columns:\n    - family\n    - MMLU_d\n    - HellaSwag_d\n    - GSM8K_d\n    - θ_fixed_monotonic\n    rows:\n    - - Qwen3.5-9B\n      - -2.5\n      - -1.2\n      - -0.9\n      - 'Yes'\n    - - Llama-3.1-8B\n      - -2.8\n      - -1.4\n      - -1.1\n      - 'Yes'\n    - - Gemma-4-31B\n      - -1.3\n      - -0.6\n      - -0.4\n      - No (50% residual)\n    - - Mistral-7B-v0.3\n      - -2.2\n      - -1.1\n      - -0.8\n      - 'Yes'\n    - - Mean\n      - -2.2\n      - -1.08\n      - -0.8\n      - 3/4\n  - title: 'Table: Memorization Fraction by Family × Benchmark'\n    columns:\n    - family\n    - MMLU\n    - HellaSwag\n    - GSM8K\n    rows:\n    - - Qwen3.5-9B\n      - 0.38\n      - 0.33\n      - 0.3\n    - - Llama-3.1-8B\n      - 0.42\n      - 0.38\n      - 0.35\n    - - Gemma-4-31B\n      - 0.28\n      - 0.25\n      - 0.22\n    - - Mistral-7B-v0.3\n      - 0.36\n      - 0.32\n      - 0.28\n  - title: 'Table: Dose-Response (MMLU, θ-fixed, ℓz*-corrected)'\n    columns:\n    - family\n    - d_5pct\n    - d_10pct\n    - d_15pct\n    - d_25pct\n    - d_50pct\n    - monotonic\n    rows:\n    - - Qwen3.5-9B\n      - -0.6\n      - -1.4\n      - -2.5\n      - -3.8\n      - -5.2\n      - 'Yes'\n    - - Llama-3.1-8B\n      - -0.75\n      - -1.6\n      - -2.8\n      - -4.2\n      - -5.8\n      - 'Yes'\n    - - Gemma-4-31B\n      - -0.3\n      - -0.7\n      - -1.3\n      - -1.8\n      - -1.6\n      - 'No'\n    - - Mistral-7B-v0.3\n      - -0.55\n      - -1.2\n      - -2.2\n      - -3.4\n      - -4.6\n      - 'Yes'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig: 4×3 panel dose-response curves (family × benchmark), θ-fixed, with 95% bootstrap\n    CIs'\n  - 'Fig: Memorization fraction heatmap (family × benchmark × contamination level)'\n  - 'Fig: seen/unseen accuracy split at 15% for all 4 families on MMLU'\n  analysis: '3/4 家族 MMLU |d|>2.0 确认检测框架跨家族有效，但 Gemma 的 boundary condition 需在论文中显式报告。\n    HellaSwag/GSM8K 的较低 d 值符合 power ∝ √n_items 理论，strengthens Claim 2。 Gemma 的残余非单调性是\n    median 档的 key limitation——需在 §6 讨论模型 ability 对检测的调制效应。 跨 benchmark memorization\n    fraction 差异表明 SFT generalization 是 benchmark-dependent 的， 支持 Claim 2 的 caveat（power\n    function 是 upper bound）。\n\n    '\n- name: Leaderboard Audit\n  plan_id: exp-leaderboard-audit\n  description: 'Open LLM Leaderboard v1 大规模 person-fit 扫描。已 ABANDONED（D011: a_r=0.111）。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    status: ABANDONED\n    reason: v1-irt-refit a_r=0.111, item alignment 54.56% → parameters too degraded\n      for audit\n  result_rationale: 'Path D 已确认 dead：MML-EM 重拟合的 discrimination 参数 a_r=0.111 远低于 0.2\n    可用阈值， 意味着 v1 leaderboard 参数下的 lz* 基本退化为 accuracy-like statistic， 无法提供 person-fit\n    特有的 response-pattern-level 信息。 在 median 档下不需要尝试——这是一个已被充分验证的 negative result。\n    数据可用性（13K+ models）写入 Discussion/Future Work 即可。\n\n    '\n  tables: []\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: 'ABANDONED。在论文 §7 Discussion 中报告：13K+ per-item data publicly available，\n    但 current IRT estimation methods 的 sample size requirements 限制了大规模审计。 Frame as\n    \"the gap between classical IRT and neural IRT estimation\" methodological contribution。\n\n    '\n- name: Natural Experiment (base→chat pairs)\n  plan_id: exp-natural-experiment\n  description: 'v1 leaderboard base→chat 模型 pairs，计算 Δlz* 作为 SFT 效应代理。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    n_pairs: 4\n    n_benchmarks: 4\n    n_significant_benchmarks: 1\n    significant_benchmark: HellaSwag\n    hellaswag_mean_delta: -2.8\n    hellaswag_p_value: 0.04\n    mmlu_p_value: 0.22\n    gsm8k_p_value: 0.18\n    arc_c_p_value: 0.45\n    individual_outlier_pairs: 0\n    overall_conclusion: weak_systematic_signal\n  result_rationale: 'Median 档下 natural experiment 受限于两个因素： (1) a_r=0.111 使 lz* 退化为\n    accuracy-like，个体 Δlz* 主要反映 Δaccuracy 而非 response pattern shift； (2) 仅 4-5 usable\n    pairs 无统计检验能力（n 太小无法做 paired t-test with power）。 HellaSwag 可能显示 marginal significance\n    因为它是最大的非 MMLU benchmark（~10K items）， 但 effect 不强。其他 benchmarks p>0.15。无个体 outlier\n    pair 显示 benchmark-specific contamination。 这是一个 P2-optional 实验，median 档下结论是 \"suggestive\n    but underpowered\"， 不进入主论文 claims，可在 appendix 报告。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - title: 'Table: Natural Experiment Δlz* (base→chat)'\n    columns:\n    - benchmark\n    - n_pairs\n    - mean_delta\n    - t_stat\n    - p_value\n    - significant\n    rows:\n    - - MMLU\n      - 4\n      - -1.2\n      - -1.45\n      - 0.22\n      - 'No'\n    - - HellaSwag\n      - 4\n      - -2.8\n      - -2.85\n      - 0.04\n      - Marginal\n    - - GSM8K\n      - 4\n      - 1.5\n      - 1.62\n      - 0.18\n      - 'No'\n    - - ARC-C\n      - 4\n      - -0.6\n      - -0.82\n      - 0.45\n      - 'No'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Paired dot plot: base vs chat lz* per pair, by benchmark'\n  analysis: 'Underpowered by design (n=4 pairs, a_r degraded)。HellaSwag marginal significance\n    可能反映 SFT 的系统效应而非 contamination。不影响论文 claims。 Appendix material，mention in §6 as\n    \"preliminary evidence consistent with SFT effects on response patterns\"。\n\n    '\n- name: v1 IRT Refit Expanded\n  plan_id: exp-v1-irt-refit-expanded\n  description: '扩大 v1 IRT 重拟合至 N≥500，验证 pilot N=63 的 a_r=0.111 是否因样本量不足。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    n_models_downloaded: 520\n    n_models_usable: 410\n    a_r_3pl: 0.13\n    a_r_2pl: -0.02\n    b_r_3pl: 0.66\n    b_r_spearman: 0.68\n    fitting_time_sec: 180\n    conclusion: negative_path_d_dead\n  result_rationale: 'Median 档预期 a_r 从 0.111（N=63）仅微升至 ~0.13（N=500+），远低于 0.2 可用阈值。\n    原因：discrimination failure 不是 sample size 问题，而是 LLM response patterns 的结构性特征——\n    classical IRT 假设 unidimensional latent trait，但 LLMs 的 ability profile 是 multi-dimensional\n    的 （不同 domain 能力独立变化），导致 item discrimination 在 aggregate 拟合中坍缩。 b_r 稳定在 0.66（difficulty\n    恢复尚可）进一步确认：问题在 discrimination 而非 difficulty。 这个 negative result 是 methodological\n    contribution——量化了 classical vs neural IRT 的 sample size gap。 N=500 满足 reviewer\n    要求的阈值，可以最终关闭 Path D。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - title: 'Table: IRT Refit Comparison (pilot vs expanded)'\n    columns:\n    - metric\n    - pilot_N63\n    - expanded_N500\n    - threshold\n    - verdict\n    rows:\n    - - 3PL a_r (Pearson)\n      - 0.111\n      - 0.13\n      - '>0.4 viable'\n      - FAIL\n    - - 2PL a_r (Pearson)\n      - -0.084\n      - -0.02\n      - '>0.4 viable'\n      - FAIL\n    - - 3PL b_r (Pearson)\n      - 0.626\n      - 0.66\n      - '>0.5 viable'\n      - PASS\n    - - 3PL b_r (Spearman)\n      - 0.656\n      - 0.68\n      - '>0.5 viable'\n      - PASS\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Scatter: PSN-IRT a vs v1-refit a (N=500), showing collapsed discrimination'\n  analysis: 'Path D 最终关闭。a_r<0.2 at N=500 confirms discrimination failure is structural,\n    not sample-size-driven。 论文 §5 报告为 \"IRT parameter estimation challenges\"（Claim\n    3c）， framing: \"the gap between classical psychometric sample requirements and\n    the scale needed for neural IRT\"。\n\n    '\n- name: 4PL vs 3PL Ablation\n  plan_id: exp-4pl-ablation\n  description: '比较 4PL vs 3PL(d=1) 下的检测灵敏度差异，量化 feasibility parameter d 的影响。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    far_4pl: 0.05\n    far_3pl_range:\n    - 0.06\n    - 0.14\n    far_2pl_range:\n    - 0.5\n    - 1.0\n    mean_power_gain_mmlu: 0.22\n    mean_power_gain_hellaswag: 0.2\n    mean_power_gain_gsm8k: 0.16\n    mean_power_gain_arc_c: 0.11\n    mean_power_gain_humaneval: 0.1\n    pct_items_d_lt_0.95_mmlu: 0.46\n    correlation_4pl_3pl_lz: 0.35\n  result_rationale: 'Median 档预期 4PL 相对 3PL 的 power gain 在 +15-25pp 范围（略低于 optimistic\n    的 +25-30pp）。 原因：46% MMLU items 有 d<0.95（从已有 PSN-IRT 参数已知），这些 items 的 upper asymptote\n    <1， high-ability models 在这些 items 上即使全对也不会产生极端 aberrance。 3PL(d=1) 强制 upper asymptote=1，对\n    high-ability models 系统性高估 expected P(correct)， 导致 false alarm inflation（6-14%）和\n    lz* 偏移。 相关性 r=0.35 表明 4PL vs 3PL lz* 存在根本性差异，不是简单缩放关系。 2PL 完全不可用（FAR 50-100%）因为同时忽略了\n    guessing 和 upper asymptote。 这个 ablation 直接支持 method design choice 的合理性。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - title: 'Table: Detection Power at 25% Contamination by Model'\n    columns:\n    - benchmark\n    - power_4PL\n    - power_3PL\n    - gain_pp\n    - pct_items_d_lt_0.95\n    rows:\n    - - MMLU\n      - 0.72\n      - 0.5\n      - 22\n      - 46%\n    - - HellaSwag\n      - 0.48\n      - 0.28\n      - 20\n      - 41%\n    - - GSM8K\n      - 0.65\n      - 0.49\n      - 16\n      - 30%\n    - - ARC-C\n      - 0.12\n      - 0.08\n      - 4\n      - 22%\n    - - HumanEval\n      - 0.28\n      - 0.18\n      - 10\n      - 35%\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Paired power curves: 4PL vs 3PL across contamination levels for each benchmark'\n  - Histogram of d parameter distribution across MMLU items, annotated with d=0.95\n    threshold\n  analysis: '4PL d parameter 对 LLM contamination detection 不可或缺。 Power gain +15-25pp\n    在论文中用 one sentence 总结即可： \"Ignoring the upper asymptote parameter halves detection\n    power on benchmarks with substantial d<0.95 items.\" 2PL 的灾难性 FAR 作为 negative control\n    报告，确认 guessing parameter 同样必要。\n\n    '\n- name: Baseline Comparison\n  plan_id: exp-baseline-comparison\n  description: '≥5 baselines 在 ctrl-contam ground-truth 上对比： IRT-FIT, ConStat, Min-K%++,\n    accuracy z-score, PPL-based, random。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    auroc_5pct:\n      lz_star: 0.65\n      accuracy_zscore: 0.53\n      mink_pp: 0.78\n      constat: 0.72\n      ppl_based: 0.75\n      random: 0.5\n    auroc_10pct:\n      lz_star: 0.74\n      accuracy_zscore: 0.58\n      mink_pp: 0.86\n      constat: 0.82\n      ppl_based: 0.83\n      random: 0.5\n    auroc_15pct:\n      lz_star: 0.8\n      accuracy_zscore: 0.62\n      mink_pp: 0.92\n      constat: 0.88\n      ppl_based: 0.9\n      random: 0.5\n    auroc_25pct:\n      lz_star: 0.86\n      accuracy_zscore: 0.7\n      mink_pp: 0.96\n      constat: 0.93\n      ppl_based: 0.95\n      random: 0.5\n    auroc_gap_at_5pct_vs_best: -0.13\n    auroc_gap_at_15pct_vs_best: -0.12\n    auroc_gap_at_25pct_vs_best: -0.1\n    lz_star_ci_width_15pct: 0.06\n    mink_pp_ci_width_15pct: 0.04\n    lz_star_rank_at_5pct: 2nd (behind Min-K%++)\n    lz_star_rank_at_15pct: 4th\n    lz_star_beats_accuracy_zscore_all_levels: true\n    information_access:\n      lz_star: binary only\n      accuracy_zscore: binary only\n      mink_pp: token probs\n      constat: retest\n      ppl_based: log-probs\n      random: none\n  result_rationale: \"Median 档核心：lz* 在 5% 低污染区间优势明确（0.65 vs accuracy_zscore 0.53，+0.12），\\\n    \\ 但 15%+ 区间落后于 Min-K%++/ConStat 10-15% AUROC。 原因分析： (1) lz* @ 5% 优于 accuracy z-score\\\n    \\ 因为它利用了 response pattern 的 item-level 信息（IRT inductive bias），\\n    而 accuracy\\\n    \\ z-score 只看 aggregate score；\\n(2) lz* @ 5% 接近 privileged methods（gap 仅 -0.13）因为低污染下\\\n    \\ privileged methods 的信号也弱，\\n    lz* 的 IRT structure 作为 inductive bias 部分补偿了 information\\\n    \\ disadvantage；\\n(3) @ 15%+ lz* 落后因为 privileged methods 获得的额外信息（token probs, retest）\\n\\\n    \\    提供了 lz* 无法获取的 fine-grained signal，信息差距随污染增加而放大；\\n(4) AUROC gap [-0.15, -0.05]\\\n    \\ 在 median 范围，诚实但不灾难性。 narrative 策略：plot information-access vs detection-power\\\n    \\ frontier curve， 强调 lz* 定义了 \\\"minimal-information operating point\\\" 的价值而非绝对性能。\\n\"\n  tables:\n  - title: 'Table: AUROC Comparison Across Contamination Levels (MMLU, mean ± 95%\n      CI)'\n    columns:\n    - method\n    - info_access\n    - 5%\n    - 10%\n    - 15%\n    - 25%\n    rows:\n    - - Random\n      - —\n      - '0.50'\n      - '0.50'\n      - '0.50'\n      - '0.50'\n    - - Acc z-score\n      - binary\n      - 0.53±0.05\n      - 0.58±0.05\n      - 0.62±0.05\n      - 0.70±0.04\n    - - lz* (ours)\n      - binary\n      - 0.65±0.06\n      - 0.74±0.06\n      - 0.80±0.06\n      - 0.86±0.05\n    - - ConStat\n      - retest\n      - 0.72±0.04\n      - 0.82±0.04\n      - 0.88±0.04\n      - 0.93±0.03\n    - - PPL-based\n      - log-probs\n      - 0.75±0.04\n      - 0.83±0.04\n      - 0.90±0.03\n      - 0.95±0.02\n    - - Min-K%++\n      - token probs\n      - 0.78±0.04\n      - 0.86±0.03\n      - 0.92±0.03\n      - 0.96±0.02\n  - title: 'Table: Information-Access vs Detection-Power Summary'\n    columns:\n    - operating_point\n    - methods\n    - AUROC_15pct_range\n    - information_required\n    rows:\n    - - Minimal\n      - lz*, acc z-score\n      - 0.62-0.80\n      - Binary response pattern only\n    - - Moderate\n      - ConStat\n      - '0.88'\n      - Retest with rephrased items\n    - - Full\n      - Min-K%++, PPL\n      - 0.90-0.92\n      - Token-level probabilities\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig: Detection frontier — x-axis: information access level (categorical), y-axis:\n    AUROC, one curve per contamination level'\n  - 'Fig: ROC curves at 15% contamination for all 6 methods, with 95% bootstrap CIs\n    as shaded bands'\n  - 'Fig: AUROC vs contamination level curves, showing lz* crossing accuracy z-score\n    early and converging toward privileged methods'\n  analysis: '关键叙事：lz* 是 minimal-information frontier 的 champion——在 binary-only 条件下显著优于\n    accuracy z-score， 且在低污染区间接近 privileged methods。15%+ 的 gap 是 information disadvantage\n    的直接后果，不是 method failure。 Bootstrap CIs 是论文的差异化优势（6/8 peer papers 不报告 variance）。\n    Detection frontier figure 是 paper 的 key contribution visualization。\n\n    '\n- name: Multiscale lzm Statistic\n  plan_id: exp-multiscale-lzm\n  description: '实现 Hong, Lin & Cheng (2021) multiscale lzm——跨 benchmark 聚合的标准化 lz*\n    总分。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    lzm_gemini15: 45.2\n    lzm_vs_per_benchmark_correlation: 0.92\n    lzm_improvement_over_avg_lz: marginal\n    n_newly_flagged: 0\n    n_newly_unflagged: 0\n    lzm_flagged_rate: 57/60 (same as per-benchmark)\n    lzm_interpretability: lower than per-benchmark (loses benchmark-specific patterns)\n  result_rationale: 'Median 档下 lzm 提供 marginal improvement：由于 LLM data 已经 universally\n    flagged（57/60）， 聚合统计量无法进一步区分。r=0.92 表明 lzm 与 avg(lz*) 高度相关，额外信息有限。 更重要的是，per-benchmark\n    lz* profile 是 contamination characterization 的核心 （如 Gemini 的 selective vs uniform\n    misfit），而 lzm 聚合丢失了这些 benchmark-specific patterns。 在 median 档下 lzm 是 nice-to-have\n    但不改变任何 claim，可降为 appendix。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - title: 'Table: lzm vs Per-Benchmark lz* for Top Anomalous Models'\n    columns:\n    - model\n    - lzm\n    - mmlu_lz\n    - hellaswag_lz\n    - gsm8k_lz\n    - pattern\n    rows:\n    - - Gemini-1.5\n      - 45.2\n      - 31.8\n      - -12.3\n      - -8.5\n      - Selective (MMLU+, others-)\n    - - Yi-Lightning\n      - 52.1\n      - 48.2\n      - 35.1\n      - 22.0\n      - Uniform positive\n    - - Doubao\n      - 18.3\n      - 25.6\n      - -5.2\n      - -10.1\n      - Mixed\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Scatter: lzm vs mean(|per-benchmark lz*|), showing near-linear relationship'\n  analysis: 'lzm 不增加 detection power，但可在 supplementary 中报告为 alternative aggregation。\n    论文主体保留 per-benchmark profile 作为 primary presentation。\n\n    '\n- name: Post-RL Hypothesis Test\n  plan_id: exp-post-rl\n  description: 'Qwen3.5-9B: SFT 污染 → GRPO 训练 → 测试 person-fit 是否保持检测力。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    pre_rl_d_15pct: -2.5\n    post_rl_d_15pct: -1.1\n    signal_retention_ratio: 0.44\n    post_rl_lz_star_contam_15: 6.2\n    post_rl_lz_star_clean: 7.8\n    post_rl_delta_lz: -1.6\n    post_rl_p_value: 0.03\n    post_rl_memorization_fraction: 0.18\n    grpo_training_steps: 2000\n    grpo_reward: rule-based (MMLU accuracy on held-out set)\n    experiment_completed_before_ddl: uncertain\n    wang_mia_post_rl_auroc: 0.52\n    lz_star_post_rl_auroc: 0.62\n  result_rationale: 'Median 档核心假设：post-RL 信号衰减但未消失（|d| 0.5-1.5），或实验未在 DDL 前完成。 预测\n    |d|=1.10（从 pre-RL 2.50 衰减 56%）：GRPO 优化 reward signal 时， RL exploration 部分覆写了 SFT\n    记忆——模型学会了 \"更好的理由\" 来选择答案， 而非依赖记忆的 response pattern。但 binary response 层面的 aberrance\n    不完全消失， 因为 RL 不直接优化 response pattern distribution，只优化 outcome。 memorization_fraction\n    从 pre-RL ~0.35 降至 ~0.18：RL 使约一半的 \"记忆\" items 转化为 \"理解\"。 关键：即使 |d|=1.10 仍然 significant\n    (p=0.03)，而 Wang et al. 证明 MIA methods 完全失效（AUROC≈0.50）。 这就是 binary-level 检测的 structural\n    advantage——RL 改变 token distribution 但不完全消除 aberrant binary patterns。 但 DDL 风险：GRPO\n    训练需要 reward model setup + 调参 + 多 seed validation，40 GPU-hrs 可能不足。 若不完整，降为 Discussion\n    中 \"structural argument + preliminary evidence\"。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - title: 'Table: Pre- vs Post-RL Detection (Qwen3.5-9B × MMLU @ 15%)'\n    columns:\n    - condition\n    - lz_star\n    - delta_lz\n    - cohens_d\n    - memorization_frac\n    rows:\n    - - Clean\n      - 7.85\n      - —\n      - —\n      - —\n    - - SFT-contam (pre-RL)\n      - 5.1\n      - -2.75\n      - -2.5\n      - 0.35\n    - - SFT-contam + GRPO (post-RL)\n      - 6.2\n      - -1.6\n      - -1.1\n      - 0.18\n  - title: 'Table: Post-RL Comparison with Wang et al. MIA Methods'\n    columns:\n    - method\n    - info_access\n    - pre_rl_auroc\n    - post_rl_auroc\n    - retention\n    rows:\n    - - lz* (ours)\n      - binary\n      - 0.8\n      - 0.62\n      - 77.5%\n    - - Min-K%++\n      - token probs\n      - 0.92\n      - 0.52\n      - 56.5%\n    - - PPL-based\n      - log-probs\n      - 0.9\n      - 0.51\n      - 56.7%\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig: lz* distribution shift: clean vs SFT-contam vs SFT-contam+GRPO, three overlaid\n    histograms'\n  - 'Fig: Detection frontier (info access vs AUROC) at pre-RL and post-RL, showing\n    lz* advantage widens post-RL'\n  analysis: 'Post-RL |d|=1.10 是 medium-to-large effect——信号衰减但 statistically significant。\n    若在 DDL 前完成：strengthens paper 显著（unique contribution: only binary method surviving\n    RL）。 若不完整：降为 Discussion，做 structural argument——\"RL modifies token distributions\n    but not binary patterns directly, so person-fit retains partial signal where MIA-based\n    methods fail completely\"。 无论哪种情况，对 EMNLP 投稿不是 blocking issue。\n\n    '\n- name: Extra Benchmarks (BBH + MATH)\n  plan_id: exp-extra-benchmarks\n  description: 'BBH (6,511 items) 和 MATH (5,000 items) 填充 1K-10K items 的 power gap。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    bbh_power_15pct: 0.68\n    math_power_15pct: 0.55\n    bbh_power_vs_theory: within 5%\n    math_power_vs_theory: within 8%\n    power_theory_R2_with_extras: 0.88\n    bbh_4pl_available: false\n    math_4pl_available: false\n    bbh_4pl_estimation_needed: true\n    math_4pl_estimation_needed: true\n    estimation_gpu_hours: 8\n    estimation_n_models_needed: 50\n  result_rationale: 'Median 档下 BBH (6.5K items) 和 MATH (5K items) 落在 power curve 的\n    \"中等\" 区间： power@15% 预期 0.55-0.68，验证 power ∝ √n_items 理论在 1K-10K 范围的插值。 BBH > MATH\n    因为 n_items 多 30%，strictly following the theoretical relationship。 关键挑战：PSN-IRT\n    可能不包含这些 benchmarks 的 4PL 参数。 如果需要自己估计 4PL，至少需要 50 个模型的 per-item responses + MML-EM\n    fitting， 这引入新的 estimation quality concern（同 Path D 的 a_r 问题）。 Median 档下 R²=0.88（含新\n    benchmarks）略低于 simulation-only 的 0.957， 反映 SFT generalization gap（theoretical\n    power 是 upper bound，actual power 受 memorization fraction 调制）。 这恰好支持 Claim 2 的\n    \"upper bound\" caveat。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - title: 'Table: Power Function Validation with Extended Benchmarks'\n    columns:\n    - benchmark\n    - n_items\n    - power_15pct_sim\n    - power_15pct_theory\n    - gap\n    rows:\n    - - HumanEval\n      - 164\n      - 0.24\n      - 0.22\n      - 0.02\n    - - ARC-C\n      - 295\n      - 0.13\n      - 0.15\n      - -0.02\n    - - MATH\n      - 5000\n      - 0.55\n      - 0.58\n      - -0.03\n    - - BBH\n      - 6511\n      - 0.68\n      - 0.72\n      - -0.04\n    - - GSM8K\n      - 1319\n      - 0.59\n      - 0.55\n      - 0.04\n    - - HellaSwag\n      - 10042\n      - 0.75\n      - 0.78\n      - -0.03\n    - - MMLU\n      - 14042\n      - 0.98\n      - 0.98\n      - 0.0\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig: Power vs √n_items with 7 benchmarks, theoretical curve overlay, 95% CI bands'\n  analysis: 'BBH/MATH 填补 1K-10K gap，strengthens Claim 2 的 power function。 但若 4PL 参数需自行估计，quality\n    concern 可能引入 noise。 如果 PSN-IRT 不包含这些参数，建议降为 appendix 或 future work。 核心 5 benchmarks\n    已足够支撑 power theory（R²=0.957）。\n\n    '\n- name: Domain-Level Analysis\n  plan_id: exp-domain-analysis\n  description: 'MMLU domain-level person-fit 分析，识别 Gemini-1.5 等模型的 domain-specific\n    污染模式。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    gemini15_all_domains_flagged: true\n    gemini15_domain_concentrated: false\n    gemini15_stem_lz: 22.0\n    gemini15_humanities_lz: 18.5\n    gemini15_social_sciences_lz: 16.2\n    gemini15_other_lz: 15.8\n    n_models_domain_concentrated: 2\n    doubao_pattern: Humanities/SocialSci negative, STEM neutral, Other positive\n    hunyuan_pattern: SocialSci high positive, STEM low\n    domain_entropy_correlation_with_contamination: 0.45\n    n_subjects_total: 57\n    gemini_subjects_flagged: 52\n  result_rationale: \"Median 档下 domain analysis 证实两种 contamination pattern： (1) Uniform\\\n    \\ contamination (Gemini-1.5): 100% accuracy across all domains，\\n    所有 domain\\\n    \\ 都 flagged，STEM 略高因为 STEM items 的 discrimination 通常更高\\n    （item difficulty variance\\\n    \\ 更大），产生更强的 aberrance signal。\\n(2) Selective contamination (Doubao, Hunyuan):\\\n    \\ domain-specific misfit patterns，\\n    某些 domain positive lz*（over-consistent，可能是\\\n    \\ domain-specific training data exposure），\\n    某些 domain negative lz*（aberrant，可能是\\\n    \\ domain mismatch）。\\nDomain entropy 与 contamination severity 的 moderate correlation\\\n    \\ (r=0.45) 表明 更均匀的 domain misfit 通常伴随更高的整体 contamination 程度——但不是强关系， 因为 SFT 的\\\n    \\ generalization 跨 domain 不均匀。\\n\"\n  tables:\n  - title: 'Table: Domain-Level lz* for Selected Models'\n    columns:\n    - model\n    - STEM\n    - Humanities\n    - Social_Sci\n    - Other\n    - pattern_type\n    rows:\n    - - Gemini-1.5\n      - 22.0\n      - 18.5\n      - 16.2\n      - 15.8\n      - Uniform positive\n    - - Yi-Lightning\n      - 50.1\n      - 45.3\n      - 48.7\n      - 42.0\n      - Uniform positive (extreme)\n    - - Doubao\n      - -2.0\n      - -13.0\n      - -14.8\n      - 4.4\n      - Selective mixed\n    - - Hunyuan\n      - 1.8\n      - 8.2\n      - 13.9\n      - 6.5\n      - Selective positive\n    - - Mistral-Large\n      - 28.5\n      - 24.1\n      - 22.0\n      - 20.3\n      - Uniform positive\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Heatmap: models (rows) × MMLU domains (cols), color = lz*, with Ward clustering\n    dendrogram'\n  - 'Radar chart: 4 selected models'' domain-level lz* profiles, overlaid'\n  analysis: Domain analysis 是 Claim 3 的 supporting evidence：contamination 不仅可以检测，\n    还可以 characterize（uniform vs selective patterns）。 Ward clustering 可能 reveal contamination\n    typology（2-3 clusters）， 为 \"Detection and Characterization\" 标题提供直接支撑。 建议作为 §5 case\n    study 的 subsection 呈现。\n","numLines":907,"startLine":1,"totalLines":907}}}
